:: Fishing Beach Fisher Arrive
<<effects>>
<<generate1>><<saveNPC 0 "fishing_beach_npc_fisher">><<person1>>
<<set $daily.fishing.fishingBeach.fisher.phase to "fishing">>
<<set $daily.fishing.fishingBeach.fisher.age to 0>>
<<set $daily.fishing.fishingBeach.fisher.drunk to 0>>
<<run fishingRecordNpcArrivalTime()>>

Another fisher, a <<person>>, walks down to the shore and sets up a short distance away.
<<if $exposed gte 1>>
	<<He>> glances at your <<lewdness>> as <<he>> sets up. "Looks like I picked the right spot today," <<he>> says with a quiet chuckle.
	<<fameexhibitionism 2>>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Fishing Beach Wait]]>><<endevent>><</link>>


:: Fishing Beach Fisher Tips Decline
<<effects>>
<<loadNPC 0 "fishing_beach_npc_fisher">><<person1>>

<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
	"I'm alright, thanks," you say quietly.
<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
	"I'm fine," you say, not looking up from your line.
<<else>>
	"Thanks, but I'm good," you say.
<</if>>
<br><br>

"Suit yourself," <<he>> says, and turns back to <<his>> rod.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Fishing Beach Wait]]>><<endevent>><</link>>


:: Fishing Beach Fisher Cliff Tip Offer
<<effects>>
<<loadNPC 0 "fishing_beach_npc_fisher">><<person1>>

The <<person>> reels in and glances over at you. "You've been at this for a while, right? There's a nice spot I could tell you about, if you want."
<br><br>

<<link [[Sure|Fishing Beach Fisher Cliff Tip]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[No thanks|Fishing Beach Fisher Tips Decline]]>><<endevent>><</link>>


:: Fishing Beach Fisher Cliff Tip
<<effects>>
<<loadNPC 0 "fishing_beach_npc_fisher">><<person1>>
<<run $fishing.locationsFound.pushUnique("fishingCoastPath")>>

"East of town, along the coast," <<he>> says. "There's a side path that cuts down to the water. There's a dock at the bottom, old, but the spot itself is nice. Good fishing. Not many people bother making the trip, so the water's cleaner out there, less trash floating around."
<br><br>

<<He>> turns back to <<his>> rod.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Fishing Beach Wait]]>><<endevent>><</link>>


:: Fishing Beach Fisher Leave Night
<<effects>>
<<loadNPC 0 "fishing_beach_npc_fisher">><<person1>>
<<set $daily.fishing.fishingBeach.fisher.phase to "finished">>

The <<person>> glances up at the darkening sky and starts to pack up <<his>> fishing gear. "I'm not a fan of night fishing around these parts. You should head home too."
<br><br>

<<clearNPC "fishing_beach_npc_fisher">>

<<link [[Next|Fishing Beach Wait]]>><<endevent>><</link>>


:: Fishing Beach Fisher Leave Weather
<<effects>>
<<loadNPC 0 "fishing_beach_npc_fisher">><<person1>>
<<set $daily.fishing.fishingBeach.fisher.phase to "finished">>

The <<person>> looks up as it begins to rain, then begins to pack up <<his>> fishing gear. "The weather is turning, I'm going to head home before it gets any worse. You should head out too."
<br><br>

<<clearNPC "fishing_beach_npc_fisher">>

<<link [[Next|Fishing Beach Wait]]>><<endevent>><</link>>


:: Fishing Beach Cat Eat Fisher
<<effects>>
<<loadNPC 0 "fishing_beach_npc_fisher">><<person1>>
You open wide and drop the whole $fishingHookedFish.type in your mouth. <<fishingEatFishTfProgress>><<lstress>><<stress -6>>
<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
<br><br>

The <<person>> goes quiet, staring at you with a confused look on <<his>> face.
<<if $rng gte 80>>
	Without a word, <<he>> starts packing up <<his>> things, giving you a look that's a mix of concern and confusion as <<he>> leaves.
	<<set $daily.fishing.fishingBeach.fisher.phase to "finished">>
	<<clearNPC "fishing_beach_npc_fisher">>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Fishing Beach Wait]]>><<endevent>><</link>>


:: Fishing Beach Events [widget]
<<widget "fishingBeachFisherAmbient">>
	<<loadNPC 0 "fishing_beach_npc_fisher">><<person1>>
	<<set $daily.fishing.fishingBeach.fisher.age += 1>>
	<<cleareventpool>>

	<<addinlineevent 1>>
		The <<personsimple>> reels in, checks the empty hook, and lets out a quiet sigh before casting back out.
	<</addinlineevent>>
	<<addinlineevent 5>>
		The <<personsimple>> reels in, re-baits the hook, and casts back out.
	<</addinlineevent>>
	<<addinlineevent 1>>
		The <<personsimple>> reels in, takes a small fish off the hook and tosses it back into the ocean before casting back out.
	<</addinlineevent>>
	<<addinlineevent 1>>
		The <<personsimple>> reels in, takes a small fish off the hook and stores it in <<his>> bag before casting back out.
	<</addinlineevent>>
	<<addinlineevent 1>>
		The <<personsimple>> picks a clump of seaweed off <<his>> line and casts back out.
	<</addinlineevent>>

	<<if $daily.fishing.fishingBeach.fisher.drunk gte 3>>
		<<addinlineevent 15>>
			The <<personsimple>> sways slightly on <<his>> feet, rod dipping toward the water.
		<</addinlineevent>>
		<<addinlineevent 1>>
			The <<personsimple>> reels in, squints at the hook, and mutters something under <<his>> breath before casting sloppily back out.
		<</addinlineevent>>
		<<addinlineevent 1>>
			The <<personsimple>> tugs <<his>> line free from a snag with more force than necessary, nearly losing <<his>> footing.
		<</addinlineevent>>
		<<addinlineevent 1>>
			The <<personsimple>> fumbles with the bait for a moment before managing to hook it, then casts back out with a grunt.
		<</addinlineevent>>
		<<addinlineevent 4>>
			The <<personsimple>> glances over at you, eyes a little unfocused. <<He>> gives you a slow, lopsided smile before turning back to <<his>> rod.
		<</addinlineevent>>
		<<addinlineevent 2>>
			The <<personsimple>> loses <<his>> balance for a moment, stumbling in the sand before catching <<himself>>. <<He>> laughs softly to <<himself>>.
		<</addinlineevent>>
	<<else>>
		<<addinlineevent 15>>
			The <<personsimple>> stands a few paces away, quiet and focused on <<his>> line.
		<</addinlineevent>>
	<</if>>

	<<addinlineevent 1>>
		The <<personsimple>> reaches into <<his>> bag, pulls out a flask, and takes a long drink before tucking it away.
		<<set $daily.fishing.fishingBeach.fisher.drunk += 1>>
	<</addinlineevent>>
	<<addinlineevent 1>>
		The <<personsimple>> pulls out a flask and drinks from it, then goes back to <<his>> rod.
		<<set $daily.fishing.fishingBeach.fisher.drunk += 1>>
	<</addinlineevent>>

	<<if $daily.fishing.fishingBeach.fisher.age gte 4>>
		<<addinlineevent 7>>
			<<set $daily.fishing.fishingBeach.fisher.age to 0>>
			The <<personsimple>> suddenly braces, struggling with the line as <<his>> rod bends around. After a tense moment, <<he>> reels in and pulls out a fish with a satisfied grunt. <<He>> holds it up briefly before unhooking it and dropping it in <<his>> cooler.
		<</addinlineevent>>
		<<addinlineevent 12>>
			<<set $daily.fishing.fishingBeach.fisher.age to 0>>
			The <<personsimple>> suddenly braces, fighting with the line as it pulls <<his>> rod around. Then <<he>> jolts back as whatever was on the line escapes.
			<<if $daily.fishing.fishingBeach.fisher.drunk gte 3>>
				<<He>> swears under <<his>> breath, fumbling with <<his>> line before eventually getting it hooked and cast back out.
			<<else>>
				With a sigh, <<he>> re-hooks <<his>> line and casts back out.
			<</if>>
		<</addinlineevent>>
	<</if>>

	<<if $exposed gte 1>>
		<<set $daily.fishing.fishingBeach.fisherOgle ??= 1>>
		<<addinlineevent $daily.fishing.fishingBeach.fisherOgle>>
			<<set $daily.fishing.fishingBeach.fisherOgle += 1>>
			The <<personsimple>>'s gaze drifts towards your <<lewdness>> before <<he>> turns back to <<his>> line.
		<</addinlineevent>>
		<<addinlineevent $daily.fishing.fishingBeach.fisherOgle>>
			<<set $daily.fishing.fishingBeach.fisherOgle += 1>>
			The <<personsimple>> glances over your <<lewdness>> with a long, slow look before turning back to <<his>> rod.
		<</addinlineevent>>
	<</if>>
	<<if $exposed gte 2>>
		<<addinlineevent $daily.fishing.fishingBeach.fisherOgle>>
			<<set $daily.fishing.fishingBeach.fisherOgle += 2>>
			The <<personsimple>> stares openly at your <<lewdness>>, not bothering to look away when you catch <<him>> looking.
		<</addinlineevent>>
		<<addinlineevent $daily.fishing.fishingBeach.fisherOgle>>
			<<set $daily.fishing.fishingBeach.fisherOgle += 2>>
			The <<personsimple>> looks over your <<lewdness>> with a slow, deliberate stare, not paying any attention to <<his>> rod.
		<</addinlineevent>>
	<</if>>

	<<runeventpool>>
	<<endevent>>
<</widget>>


:: Fishing Beach Fisher Give Fish
<<effects>>
<<loadNPC 0 "fishing_beach_npc_fisher">><<person1>>
The <<person>> snatches it from your hands and staggers off, muttering about "respekt" and "my spot."
<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
<br><br>

<<set $daily.fishing.fishingBeach.fisher.phase to "finished">>
<<clearNPC "fishing_beach_npc_fisher">>

<<link [[Next|Fishing Beach Wait]]>><<set $fishingAmbientOverride to "castOut">><<endevent>><</link>>


:: Fishing Beach Fisher Give Fish Attack
<<effects>>
<<loadNPC 0 "fishing_beach_npc_fisher">><<person1>>
<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
	"But I caught it... it's mine."
<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
	"Not a chance. Get your own."
<<else>>
	"No. I caught it."
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<He>> narrows <<his>> eyes. "I tend to take what I want," <<he>> says as <<he>> strides towards you.
<br><br>

<<link [[Fight|Fishing Beach Fisher Molestation]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>


:: Fishing Beach Fisher Molestation
<<if $molestationstart is 1>>
	<<set $molestationstart to 0>>
	<<controlloss>>
	<<violence 1>>
	<<neutral 1>>
	<<molested>>
	<<set $enemyno to 1>>
	<<maninit>>
<</if>>

<<effects>>
<<effectsman>>
<<alarmstate>>
<<man>>
<<stateman>>
<br><br>

<<actionsman>>

<<if _combatend>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Fishing Beach Fisher Molestation Finish]]>><</link>></span>
<<else>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Fishing Beach Fisher Molestation]]>><</link>></span>
<</if>>


:: Fishing Beach Fisher Molestation Finish
<<effects>>
<<set $daily.fishing.fishingBeach.fisher.phase to "finished">>

<<if $enemyarousal gte $enemyarousalmax>>
	<<ejaculation>>
	<<He>> shudders and pulls away, breathing hard. After a moment, <<he>> snatches up the $fishingHookedFish.type you'd caught, then staggers up the beach and disappears over a dune.
	<br><br>

	<<tearful>> you get to your feet.
	<br><br>

	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>
	<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
	<<clearNPC "fishing_beach_npc_fisher">>

	<<link [[Return to fishing|Fishing Beach Wait]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Leave|Beach]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<<elseif $enemyhealth lte 0>>
	<<He>> stumbles back, gasping. <<He>> looks at you for a moment, then turns and walks away, leaving the beach behind.
	<br><br>

	<<tearful>> you gather yourself.
	<br><br>

	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>
	<<tending_give $fishingHookedFish.type 1>>
	<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
	<<clearNPC "fishing_beach_npc_fisher">>

	<<link [[Return to fishing|Fishing Beach Wait]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Leave|Beach]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Fishing Beach Fisher Exposed Attack
<<effects>>
<<loadNPC 0 "fishing_beach_npc_fisher">><<person1>>
The <<person>> reels in <<his>> line and props <<his>> rod in the sand. <<He>> turns and looks you over your <<lewdness>>. "I know an invitation when I see one," <<he>> says, and walks toward you.<<stress 4>><<gstress>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Fishing Beach Fisher Exposed Molestation]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>


